# Testing workflow
- Define user-visible acceptance cases before implementing complex features.
- Use unit tests for pure logic, integration tests for API/database, and Playwright E2E for critical user flows.
- Run accessibility checks and responsive smoke tests before release.
- For bug fixes add a regression test where feasible.
- Never bypass or disable tests solely to make a build green. Explain missing coverage.
